 the night before Commencement.","evidence_claim":"University of Richmond identifies Candlelight Ceremony as one of its longest-standing traditions and says graduates gather with candles at Westhampton Lake at 10 p.m. the night before Commencement.","source_url":"https://urnow.richmond.edu/features/article/-/23090/commencement-traditions-offer-a-chance-to-celebrate-and-reflect.html","source_title":"Commencement traditions offer a chance to celebrate and reflect","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-05-08","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For graduating students on the night before Commencement; confirm the current ceremony schedule and weather plan.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ur-proclamation-letter","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Westhampton College Proclamation Letter","title":"Write to Your Senior Self","subtitle":"A Proclamation tradition","notes":"Write and seal the letter with a future reading in mind, then keep the sealed message for the senior-year Proclamation moment.","short_summary":"Westhampton students write a sealed letter to their future selves and reopen it as seniors.","evidence_claim":"University of Richmond Magazine calls Proclamation a Westhampton College tradition and identifies writing, sealing, and later opening a letter to one’s future self as integral to it.","source_url":"https://magazine.richmond.edu/article/-/24208/88-101.html","source_title":"88–101","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-03-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Part of Westhampton College Proclamation; contact the Westhampton College Dean’s Office for current-year details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ur-westhampton-ring-dance","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Westhampton College Ring Dance","title":"Process 